    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harold Rabbit and the Case of the Pastry Pirate</strong> is a hand-drawn adventure game full of colourful characters and funny interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807480/extras/e6c7b7a4887a8dcc8d7923fd864a67c0.avif?t=1752311956\" width=608 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pastry pirate is on the loose, and no cake or cookie is safe!<br><br><strong>Margaret Fox</strong> just had her birthday cake attacked and half-eaten, and<strong> Matilda Squirrel's</strong> pastry stall has been ransacked as well!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807480/extras/42ec8335ca264f469cfbfc76fae2adc9.avif?t=1752311956\" width=237 height=220 /></span><br>Find clues about the identity of the culprit, and where he is hiding, and solve the <strong>Case of the Pastry Pirate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807480/extras/df74ca8b5d84c0d4475994a2b439f1d1.avif?t=1752311956\" width=357 height=458 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harold Rabbit and the Case of the Pastry Pirate</strong> is a hand-drawn adventure game full of colourful characters and funny interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807480/extras/e6c7b7a4887a8dcc8d7923fd864a67c0.avif?t=1752311956\" width=608 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pastry pirate is on the loose, and no cake or cookie is safe!<br><br><strong>Margaret Fox</strong> just had her birthday cake attacked and half-eaten, and<strong> Matilda Squirrel's</strong> pastry stall has been ransacked as well!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807480/extras/42ec8335ca264f469cfbfc76fae2adc9.avif?t=1752311956\" width=237 height=220 /></span><br>Find clues about the identity of the culprit, and where he is hiding, and solve the <strong>Case of the Pastry Pirate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807480/extras/df74ca8b5d84c0d4475994a2b439f1d1.avif?t=1752311956\" width=357 height=458 /></span></p>",
